   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">SSM helped launch trilateral cooperation on nuclear safety and security between Ukraine, Norway and Sweden to support the Khmelnitsky NPP regarding modernization and improvement of its physical protection system in order to meet international standards. In 2017 the first Phase of modernization of the PPS at the KhNPP inclusively equipment for access control, CCTV surveillance, central control room and perimeter has been implemented and a new contract for implementation of Phase 2 has been concluded.</narrative>
